# Ownership for review routing. This repository requires no approving review, so
# these entries request a reviewer rather than block a merge — the automated
# controls (distribution-verify, required pull requests, linear history,
# rebase-only merges) are the enforcing gates.
#
# The paths below are the ones where an unnoticed change is most costly: the
# release verifier and its workflow are the integrity control, and .release/ is
# the provenance a consumer checks a published tree against.

/.github/                 @The01Geek
/.github/verify-release.py @The01Geek
/.release/                @The01Geek
/install.sh               @The01Geek
/.claude-plugin/          @The01Geek
